<node id="&quot;CYTOPLASM&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"GEO"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Cytoplasm is the cellular compartment where ATE1 is active and located."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cytoplasm is the cellular material outside the nucleus."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cytoplasm is the contents of a cell excluding the nucleus, containing various organelles and components involved in cellular functions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cytoplasm is the jelly-like substance inside a cell, excluding the nucleus, where many cellular processes occur."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cytoplasm refers to the jelly-like substance inside the cell membrane, excluding the nucleus, where various biochemical reactions occur."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Cytoplasm is the cellular compartment where many autophagy-related processes occur, including the localization of ATG9B."&lt;SEP&gt;"The cytoplasm is the gel-like substance within a cell, excluding the nucleus, where many cellular activities occur."&lt;SEP&gt;"The cytoplasm is the intracellular fluid outside the nucleus where various biochemical processes occur."&lt;SEP&gt;"The cytoplasm is the jelly-like substance within a cell, containing various organelles and structures involved in cellular functions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The jelly-like substance inside a cell where most cellular reactions occur."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-daff5f83917cc6f9ded289c270e2129b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73933ba64ffac4e6b0a92e59eac8d328&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6af7852122b20fd32632d05ee60db0b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-253eb098498cf4c2d668ce32dfcd8748&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7832e6342cbbf4e201eb3abbeccf544b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bbbe6b035d10996de43125a54fa4ac7c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3688619fce16d8bee5f1c0f6aea46a1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3506d0e7e897cc0dd02aaad510a5bdca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d1ed23d3600b0b8091acfc263f6b6e3f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02805be411719fee5bfd259f3abcf8b6</data>
